2026-11-02T09:52:01Z SEND 185.57.187.105:60078 - I_dispatch,DISPATCH 1 0128531bc41e0d07 [Night watch] Couriers ride on a schedule. Your next signal must be *created* inside the window below -- not merely arrive inside it. The time that counts is the one your own server stamps into the message when it first sends it into the botnet, so a message created in the window and delayed on the road still counts, and one created early and sent late does not. Any answer will do; it is the timing I am checking. The message you reply with must have been *created* between 2026-10-31T09:25:31Z and 2026-10-31T12:25:31Z -- that is the timestamp your own server puts in the SENDMSG, not the time it happens to reach me. Reply to I_dispatch with: REPLY 0128531bc41e0d07 <your answer>
